{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">颱風「沙德爾」上午登陸浙江後，減弱為強烈熱帶風暴。「沙德爾」亦為台灣帶來暴雨，雨勢疊加天文潮，多地嚴重水浸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">屏東多個鄉鎮早上雨勢強勁，街道被水淹浸，汽車駛過時濺起大量水花。雨水亦流入低窪地區，形成小河道。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1230.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026R0olrMmCYi1787903752.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1230.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">高雄早上亦下暴雨，引發水浸，沿海路變成河流。早上上班繁忙時間，水浸影響交通，大量車及電單車排長龍，要減速通過。高雄大寮區就有小學外街道水浸，水深一度至成人大腿，學校要停課。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1230_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026k4yWI7S8Ar1787904218.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TW.RAIN-1230_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T08:21:44.785154+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}